{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07889","headline":"奉先张明府休沐还乡海亭宴集 · 孟浩然","name":"奉先张明府休沐还乡海亭宴集","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"自君理畿甸，予亦经江淮。\n万里书信断，数年云雨乖。\n归来休澣日，始得赏心谐。\n朱绂恩虽重，沧州趣每怀。\n树低新舞阁，山对旧书斋。\n何以发秋兴，阴虫鸣夜堦。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟浩然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07889.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07889","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}